tPhrase":"얼음빼주세요"},{"scenario":"Fixing an order","question":"ask to replace the coffee with tea you ordered tea but received coffee","taughtPhrase":"차로바꿔주세요"},{"scenario":"Choosing an alternative","question":"ask for an americano instead your first choice is sold out no drink is served","taughtPhrase":"아메리카노로주세요"},{"scenario":"Arriving at the café","question":"greet the café staff politely say hello as you enter","taughtPhrase":"안녕하세요"},{"scenario":"Ordering a drink","question":"order one cup of coffee ask for exactly one coffee not tea","taughtPhrase":"커피한잔주세요"},{"scenario":"Choosing a temperature","question":"order a hot coffee you do not want a cold drink or tea","taughtPhrase":"따뜻한커피주세요"},{"scenario":"Adding milk","question":"ask for milk in your coffee add milk rather than sugar","taughtPhrase":"우유넣어주세요"},{"scenario":"Clearing your table","question":"ask where to put your empty cup you have finished your drink","taughtPhrase":"컵은어디에놓으면돼요"},{"scenario":"Requesting permission","question":"ask if you may charge your phone request permission to use the café outlet","taughtPhrase":"여기서충전해도돼요"}]}
