lic hints, for creator use.","spokenPrompt":"","choices":[{"hangul":"나눠 먹을 접시 하나 더 주세요.","romanization":"nanwo meogeul jeopsi hana deo juseyo."},{"hangul":"메뉴 오늘 다 팔려요?","romanization":"menyu oneul daryeoyo?"},{"hangul":"케이크가 남았나요?","romanization":"keikeuga namonnayo?"}],"correctAnswerIndex":0,"translation":"Please give one more plate for sharing (private answer).","explanation":"This item is used for creator review to confirm difficulty level and teaching point alignment.","teachingPoint":"Private review note for content quality and alignment."}}
